<h3>FAQ</h3>
<div class="table-scroll">
<table>
<caption>Early Access FAQ</caption>
<thead>
<tr>
<th scope="col">Q</th>
<th scope="col">A</th>
<th scope="col">Status</th>
<th scope="col">Last verified</th>
<th scope="col">Sources</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Who qualifies for Early Access?</td>
<td>数字预购或预购 <strong>Standard Digital Edition 或 Vault Edition</strong> 的玩家（官方列名平台见上表）。实体版权益以商店/包装说明为准，本页不扩展未核细则。</td>
<td>confirmed（数字版资格）</td>
<td>2026-10-24</td>
<td><a href="#source-2">[2]</a><a href="#source-3">[3]</a><a href="#source-5">[5]</a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>When does EA start / end?</td>
<td><strong>战役 EA：</strong> 自 <strong>October 16</strong> 起，至正式发售 <strong>October 23</strong>。<strong>DMZ EA：</strong> 自 <strong>October 20</strong> 起。官方脚注：时区差异与停机可能影响实际可玩时间——本站<strong>不写几点开服</strong>。</td>
<td>confirmed（日历日）</td>
<td>2026-10-24</td>
<td><a href="#source-2">[2]</a><a href="#source-3">[3]</a><a href="#source-5">[5]</a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>What content is in EA?</td>
<td><strong>战役：</strong> entire Campaign（十六关叙述见 <a href="/mw4-campaign/">/mw4-campaign/</a> / <a href="/mw4-campaign-early-access/">/mw4-campaign-early-access/</a>）。<strong>DMZ：</strong> all of DMZ（自 Oct 20）。其余未官方点名模式/地图细节不写入卖点。</td>
<td>confirmed</td>
<td>2026-10-24</td>
<td><a href="#source-2">[2]</a><a href="#source-3">[3]</a><a href="#source-5">[5]</a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Is EA the same on every platform?</td>
<td>官方将同一数字版 EA 权益列于多平台（含 Steam）；实际开服可能因时区/平台而异（见脚注）。价格与 SKU 仍以各商店为准。</td>
<td>confirmed（列名一致）/ 时钟差异不填表</td>
<td>2026-10-24</td>
<td><a href="#source-2">[2]</a><a href="#source-5">[5]</a></td>
</tr>
